332:  * Nothing about an ambient system is allowed to be instant. A recipe that
333:  * starts at its full rate drops a whole field of leaves into the air over one
334:  * particle lifetime, and one disposed the moment it stops being eligible takes
335:  * every leaf still flying with it - both read as a pop. Emission ramps
336:  * instead, and what is already in the air drains through its own lifetime.
