279: /**
280:  * The scrolling twin of whatever material a mesh already resolved to, keeping
281:  * its blend state and culling. Used for a `blend`-kind scroller, whose mesh
282:  * `applyBlendMesh` has already put on the shared additive material.
283:  */
284: export function getScrollVariant(
285:   scene: Scene,
