379: /**
380:  * One parsed copy of each GLB, kept for the whole session and cloned per
381:  * entity (`instantiateModelsToScene`). Before this, every instance of every
382:  * map object ran its own glTF parse, geometry upload and WebP decode - a
383:  * Lorencia field with 40 grass tufts paid for 40 identical models, and paid
384:  * again every time the hero walked out of `CalculateVisibilitySystem`'s
385:  * radius and back. Clones share the geometry (`Geometry.applyToMesh`), so the
386:  * cache is strictly less GPU memory than the duplication it replaces.
387:  */
