389: 
390: /**
391:  * Set to false to bypass the cache entirely and give every request its own
392:  * freshly parsed, non-cloned copy - what the loader did before the container
393:  * cache landed.
394:  *
395:  * Kept as a one-line A/B. If a model ever renders in its raw BMD orientation
396:  * (see the coordinate note in `modelObject.load`), flipping this says at once
397:  * whether the clone path is responsible or whether the problem predates it.
398:  */
399: const USE_MODEL_CONTAINER_CACHE = true;
