11:  * whole difference: the body burns and the fire lights the floor
12:  * (ZzzCharacter.cpp:5943-5958). The floor light is the lighting layer's -
13:  * `CHARACTER_LIGHTS[35]` carries the (0.8, 0.16, 0) range-2 row - and this is
