1372:    * draw call, and Noria places 9399 objects - 2336 of them ground flowers
1373:    * about a third of a tile tall. The shadow of a thing that short is a
1374:    * smudge under a thing already touching the ground: it costs a mesh and a
1375:    * draw call to change nothing on screen. Lorencia is 2154 objects and never
1376:    * made this hurt; the foliage maps are where an eager per-object clone stops
1377:    * being affordable.
