  95:  * placement's packed BodyLight, a the snow-cap openness of its tile. It is a
  96:  * thin-instance attribute, so it exists only on an `INSTANCES` compile; every
  97:  * other draw gets the varying at (1, 1, 1, 1) and the uniforms it multiplies
